    /// <para>Equivalent to <c>RPlot::plot(x, y)</c>: one unlabeled scatter series drawn in blue
    /// <c>{37, 99, 235}</c> with 4-pixel markers; axis ranges fit the data. The coordinates are
    /// copied (or moved from rvalues); <c>dm::Vector&lt;double&gt;</c> converts implicitly. Restyle the
    /// points afterwards with set_col().</para>
    /// <para><b>Example</b></para>
