    /// dimensions multiply, giving <c>\bigl(\sqrt{2k^2-1}/k^2\bigr)^d</c>. It is 1 at <c>k=1</c> and
    /// 0 (infinite weight variance) for <c>k\le1/\sqrt2</c>.</para>
